
These steps are required to be completed on the NV Link Switches if the ZTP fails or other issues occur

Prerequisites: NV Link Switches are properly provisioned in BCM
BCM Steps
Download the cm-lite-daemon package and extract the zip
#Start at the root directory
cd /root

apt update
apt install cm-lite-daemon
unzip /cm/shared/apps/cm-lite-daemon-dist/cm-lite-daemon.zip

#Check the cm-lite-daemon exists 
ls -l /root
drwxr-xr-x 7 root root 4096 Oct 31  2017 cm-lite-daemon
Create a directory for pip packages:
mkdir ~/pip_packages_dep
cd ~/pip_packages_dep
Download the required Python packages from the cm-lite-daemon requirements file
pip download --python-version 3.11 -r ~/cm-lite-daemon/requirements.txt --dest ./ --no-deps
Validate all Python packages exist against the requirements.txt
root@bcm10-headnode:~/pip_packages_dep# cat ~/cm-lite-daemon/requirements.txt 
pyOpenSSL>=21.0.0
websocket-client
pyyaml
psutil
py-cpuinfo
uptime
netifaces
py-dmidecode
requests

