Copy the cm-lite-daemon.zip and Python packages to the switch
scp /cm/shared/apps/cm-lite-daemon-dist/cm-lite-daemon.zip cumulus@{switch_ip}:/home/cumulus
scp -r ~/pip_packages_dep cumulus@{switch_ip}:/home/cumulus
Copy the bootstrap keys to the Cumulus device 
scp /cm/local/apps/cmd/etc/htdocs/switch/{switch_name}/bootstrap.* cumulus@{switch_ip}:/home/cumulus 

Determine active BCM headnode which will be used later 
cmsh -c 'device; use master; get ip'


NV Link Switch
Ssh into the switch 
Install unzip packages and extract the cm-lite-daemon.zip 
sudo apt update
sudo apt install unzip
sudo unzip cm-lite-daemon.zip

cumulus@cumulus:mgmt:~$ ls -l
total 168
-rw------- 1 cumulus cumulus   1704 Jul 25 21:44 bootstrap.key
-rw------- 1 cumulus cumulus   1285 Jul 25 21:44 bootstrap.pem
drwxr-xr-x 7 root    root      4096 Oct 31  2017 cm-lite-daemon
-rw-r--r-- 1 cumulus cumulus 159540 Jul 25 21:29 cm-lite-daemon.zip

cumulus@cumulus:mgmt:~$ 

Install Python developer packages
sudo apt update
sudo apt install build-essential python3-dev
Move the cm-lite-daemon, the bootstrap keys, and install Python dependencies:
sudo apt install python3-openssl

sudo cp -r /home/cumulus/cm-lite-daemon /opt
cd /opt/cm-lite-daemon

sudo cp bootstrap.* /opt/cm-lite-daemon/etc/

cd /opt/cm-lite-daemon/etc/

sudo pip install --break-system-packages --no-index --find-links ~/pip_packages_dep -r requirements.txt

Register the node to BCM
sudo ./register_node --host <active_bcm> --disable-cert-check --vrf mgmt

